  "inline_comments": [
    {
      "body": "![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)\n\nFor better type safety, consistency with other `empty_topk_output` implementations (such as the one in `topk.py`), and to assist static analysis tools, please add the return type annotation `-> StandardTopKOutput` to this method.\n\n```suggestion\n    def empty_topk_output(\n        self, device: torch.device, *, layer_id: Optional[int] = None\n    ) -> StandardTopKOutput:\n```",
